You! You, using Geonet! Great!
I tell you this in confidence.{VAR BE01}
With the latest technology, we can trade
Pokémon with people far away!{VAR BE01}
...I know it sounds crazy,
but give it a try. You'll be surprised!

Oh! You know Geonet!
Great, great!{VAR BE01}
